  "name": "Delete Child Docs and Retry",
  "api_name": "delete_child_docs_and_retry",
  "ai_description": "\nTriggered manually on a 'Document Sets' record, this 3-step automation resets a document for reprocessing. The workflow begins by archiving all related 'Sub Document Records', effectively deleting any child documents that were previously created. It then changes the 'Indexing Complete' field on the parent record to 'No', resetting its processing status. The automation concludes by starting the 'Document Orchestration v2' workflow to re-initiate the entire document analysis and processing sequence.\n",
